# Middleware/TTFB guardrails

## Default stance

- Prefer **no middleware** unless absolutely necessary.
- Never add request-time third-party fetches in middleware/edge.

## If middleware is introduced

- Keep it cheap: redirects/headers only.
- No heavy parsing, no crypto, no network I/O.
- Verify TTFB impact with traces before merging.

